(PART A — INSTRUCTIONS TO BIDDERS) Tj T*
(1. The bidder shall submit the EMD in the form of online payment or bank guarantee from a) Tj T*
(scheduled bank.) Tj T*
(2. The tender documents may be downloaded from the e-procurement portal of the Government.) Tj T*
