() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(i\) The equipment shall be designed for a maximum ambient temperature of 40°C.) Tj T*
(ii\) Relative humidity at site may reach 95%.) Tj T*
(iii\) The installation is at an altitude of less than 1000 m above mean sea level.) Tj T*
