() Tj T*
(PART D — MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(i\) The LT panel shall conform to IS/IEC 61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(ii\) The panel shall be cubicle type, floor mounted, fabricated from CRCA sheet steel of 2 mm) Tj T*
(thickness.) Tj T*
(iii\) The rated operational voltage shall be 415V, 3 phase, 4 wire, 50 Hz.) Tj T*
(iv\) Main busbars shall be of electrolytic grade aluminium rated for 1600 A continuous current.) Tj T*
(v\) The busbars and panel shall withstand a short circuit current of 50kA for 1 second.) Tj T*
(vi\) The degree of protection of the panel enclosure shall be IP54.) Tj T*
(vii\) The switchboard shall have Form 3b internal separation.) Tj T*
(viii\) Incomers shall be 1600 A, 4 pole, electrically operated air circuit breakers conforming) Tj T*
(to IS/IEC 60947-2:2003.) Tj T*
(ix\) Outgoing feeders shall be MCCBs with ultimate breaking capacity of 36kA.) Tj T*
(x\) Multifunction meters of accuracy class 0.5 shall be provided on each incomer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated voltage: 415V) Tj T*
(Rated current of main busbar: 1600 A) Tj T*
(Short time current rating: 50kA for 1 s) Tj T*
(Degree of protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(i\) Power cables shall be 1.1 kV grade, aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured and PVC) Tj T*
(sheathed, conforming to IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(ii\) The main feeder cable shall be 3.5 core 300 sq mm.) Tj T*
(iii\) The cables shall be suitable for a maximum continuous conductor temperature of 90°C.) Tj T*
(iv\) Control cables shall be PVC insulated, copper conductor of 2.5 sq mm, 1.1 kV grade,) Tj T*
(conforming to IS 1554 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
