() Tj T*
(6 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(i\) Routine verification of each assembly shall be carried out in accordance with IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1.) Tj T*
(ii\) Type test certificates of the offered panel design from a NABL accredited laboratory shall) Tj T*
(be submitted.) Tj T*
(iii\) Routine test certificates of cables shall be furnished with each consignment.) Tj T*
(iv\) The equipment shall be inspected by the Engineer-in-charge at the manufacturer's works) Tj T*
(before dispatch.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(i\) The contractor shall submit detailed shop drawings for approval within 21 days of award of) Tj T*
(work.) Tj T*
(ii\) Three sets of operation and maintenance manuals shall be handed over on completion.) Tj T*
(iii\) The complete installation shall be guaranteed against defective design, material and) Tj T*
(workmanship for a period of 12 months from the date of handing over.) Tj T*
(iv\) The contractor shall train the Department's operating staff in operation and routine) Tj T*
(maintenance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
